<p>France has limited U.S. Ambassador to France Charles Kushner’s direct access to French government ministers after he skipped a Foreign Ministry meeting called to address U.S.-linked social-media comments on the killing of 23-year-old French far-right activist Quentin Deranque. The dispute began after the U.S. Embassy in Paris reposted and translated a U.S. State Department counterterrorism bureau statement about Deranque’s death that warned “violent radical leftism” was rising. French officials described the step as a downgrade in access, not a break in relations, and said working-level channels would stay open for necessary exchanges between the allies.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/wDxsNsNeJwxmcuqSok7EwK06i4WpBhFHkcwpeX5uwAvAjj7VkIw_fdxQzOLvy3S4TIhUaRAYUgPOoKAq6V8NGNPE90YQltXUYNetCOFB6CKyW0WSj_x3B3p8hWtRG5qWKl2rBuTs1WabswDj6aPhZ2Po2DRTsSqDZRHusJuUXjsFO3gste0ZLQnWByGT-klvckFWHtY-IuOEGg' alt='Charles Kushner, the U.S. ambassador to France, and his wife, Seryl Kushner, leaving the Élysée Palace in Paris in July.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Meeting details: The Foreign Ministry summoned Kushner to a Monday evening meeting (reported as 7 p.m.), but he did not show up.</li><li>How France framed it: A French diplomat, speaking anonymously, said Barrot saw the no-show as a misunderstanding of the “basic expectations of an ambassador” and asked for the access downgrade.</li><li>U.S. response: The U.S. embassy did not immediately respond to POLITICO’s request for comment.</li><li>Personal context: Several reports noted Kushner is the father of Jared Kushner, who is married to Ivanka Trump.</li></ul><blockquote>It is, of course, still possible for Ambassador Charles Kushner to carry out his duties and come to the Quai d’Orsay, so that we can have the diplomatic exchanges needed to smooth over the irritants that inevitably arise in a 250-year-old friendship, - French diplomat (unnamed)</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>France’s Foreign Minister Jean-Noël Barrot: Barrot said France would not “allow this tragedy to be exploited for political ends” when reacting to the U.S. social-media comments. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/us-ambassador-to-france-fails-to-show-up-for-diplomatic-summons/'>POLITICO Europe</a>)</li><li>U.S. State Department counterterrorism bureau: In a statement reposted by the U.S. Embassy in Paris, the bureau argued that “violent radical leftism is on the rise” and framed Deranque’s death as evidence of a public-safety threat. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/us-ambassador-to-france-fails-to-show-up-for-diplomatic-summons/'>POLITICO Europe</a>)</li><li>U.S. Embassy in Paris: The embassy did not immediately respond to POLITICO’s request for comment on the French decision. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/us-ambassador-to-france-fails-to-show-up-for-diplomatic-summons/'>POLITICO Europe</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/23/world/europe/france-us-ambassador-kushner-activist-killing.html'>France Summons U.S. Ambassador Over Comments on Activist’s Killing</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1rcujsp/us_ambassador_to_france_banned_from_meeting/'>US ambassador to France banned from meeting French government</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/02/24/g-s1-111302/france-moves-to-bar-us-ambassador-charles-kushner-from-direct-government-access'>France moves to bar US Ambassador Charles Kushner from direct government access</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/02/23/france-to-revoke-us-envoy-kushner-s-government-access-after-no-show_6750803_4.html'>France to revoke US envoy Kushner&#x27;s government access after no-show</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/02/24/us-ambassador-to-france-barred-from-government-access-after-failing-to-show-up-for-summons'>US ambassador to France barred from government access after failing to show up for summons</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/us-ambassador-to-france-banned-from-meeting-french-government'>France to revoke US envoy’s government access after summons no-show</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8d5eg5pl34o'>French minister moves to block US envoy Kushner from government access</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/us-ambassador-to-france-fails-to-show-up-for-diplomatic-summons/'>US ambassador to France fails to show up for diplomatic summons</a> - politico.eu</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/23/us-ambassador-to-paris-banned-from-meeting-french-ministers-after-no-show'>France blocks US ambassador’s access to ministers after he fails to show for meeting</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/us-ambassador-france-banned-meeting-french-government-2026-02-23/'>France restricts United States ambassador Charles Kushner&#x27;s direct access to government ministers after he skipped a meeting requested by foreign minister Jean-Noël Barrot to address comments concerning the killing of Quentin Deranque.</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>